root and be able to troll people's files at will. What having root
really means is that like a doctor, they want me on call to immediately
fix things anytime. However, unlike a doctor, I don't get a Porsche. 
A doctor also gets grateful patients, all sys admins ever see is
cranky users that seem to be wired into permanent instant-gratification
